OL,3,ARussell Brand was a 'sexual predator',
OL,4,Asays prosecution as rape trial begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand was described as
OL,7,F"ruthless" and a "sexual predator" by
OL,8,Fthe prosecution at the start of his
OL,9,Ftrial for rape and sexual assault on
OL,10,FWednesday.
OL,12,FThe 51-year-old actor and comedian
OL,13,Ffaces three counts of rape, three
OL,14,Fcharges of sexual assault and one of
OL,15,Findecent assault.
OL,17,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,18,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,19,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies the
OL,20,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
