OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussell T Davies criticises BBC boss's
OL,4,A'clumsy' AI Doctor Who comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FAddressing criticism he has received,
OL,7,FBrittin told a staff meeting last week
OL,8,Fhe was attempting to make a point
OL,9,Faround the "pace of change" while
OL,10,Fstressing he believed in "human
OL,11,Fcreativity".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
